{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16607","headline":"重阳日陪韦卿讌 · 朱湾","name":"重阳日陪韦卿讌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何必龙山好，南亭赏不暌。\n清规陈侯事，雅兴谢公题。\n入座青峰近，当轩远树齐。\n仙家自有月，莫叹夕阳西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱湾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16607.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16607","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}